      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>And she become [the wife] of \u1e62ul\u1e25 b. [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>[and he gave/wrote] her as mohar the portions/his portion [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>in the house of Abraham [&hellip;] b. \u1e24ota[m(?) &hellip;]</li>\n<li>the north [inside] the gate of his place [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>[&hellip;] the public thoroughfare and above [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>from the room/apartment of his father(?) and to the sou[th &hellip; to]</li>\n<li>the east the rooms/apartments of Bar \u1e62ul\u1e25 b. &Scaron;[&hellip;]</li>\n<li>and the windows(?) [&hellip;] of Job/Ayy\u016bb b. [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>the public thoroughfare, and its value [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>dinars. And she brought in from her parents' home [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>[&hellip;]</li>\n<li>dinars(?) [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>three(?) [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>[&hellip;]</li>\n<li>[&hellip;]</li>\n<li>a chest [&hellip;] 10 dinars [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>fifty two. And they stipulated(?) [&hellip; Undertaken]</li>\n<li>by me, I \u1e62ul\u1e25 the groom b. [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>which I possess and which I shall acquire, wh[ether movables &hellip;]</li>\n<li>between them(?)</li>\n<li>[&hellip;]</li>\n<li>trustworthy, binding and valid.</li>\n<li>[.]A (apparently the remnant of a signature) [&hellip;]</li></ol>\n",
